{% extends "synthesis_layout.jinja2" %}

{% block category_task %}
Write an authoritative biographical encyclopedia article on the historical individual: **{{ topic_name }}**.
{% endblock %}

{% block category_architecture %}
1. THE ORIENTING LEDE (NO SUBHEADING):
   - 1 concise paragraph (under 120 words) identifying who this person was, their titles or offices, historical era, and core significance.
2. CHRONOLOGICAL & THEMATIC BODY:
   - Organize into 2 to 4 logical '{{ body_heading_prefix }}' sections based on attested records (e.g., `{{ body_heading_prefix }} Early Career and Administrative Postings`, `{{ body_heading_prefix }} Diplomatic and Regional Engagements`).
   {% if subtopics %}
   - Principal sections to address: {{ subtopics | join(", ") }}.
   {% endif %}
3. BIOGRAPHICAL TREATMENT & DOCUMENTATION:
   - Conclude with `{{ body_heading_prefix }} Legacy and Documentation` evaluating how contributors and contemporaries recorded this figure in the Society's literature.
{% endblock %}